orporate those authentic, traditional instruments, you create a new narrative that celebrates both the past and the present. I'd love to hear more about the specific instruments you used and how they influenced the overall feel of the remix. Have you thought about creating more pieces that combine different styles, perhaps even branching into other genres? It could be intriguing to see how different cultural influences intertwine in your music, enhancing your artistic expression even further. Additionally, collaborating with artists who specialize in different genres could also open up fresh avenues for your creativity. Overall, it sounds like you’re on an inspiring journey in your music-making process, one that could lead to truly innovative experiences.\n\nInformation needed:\n[{\"description\": \"I recently attended an event where there was a unique blend of modern beats with Pacific sounds.\", \"id\": \"answer\", \"time_scope\": null}, {\"description\": \"What events have I attended that involved a unique blend of modern beats with Pacific sounds?\", \"id\": \"subtask_event\", \"time_scope\": null}]"
